{"date":"2010-11-20","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/64/bb/28020_kKKcF.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/64/bb/28020_kKKcF.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/64/bb/28020_kKKcF.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/64/bb/28020_kKKcF.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/64/bb/28020_kKKcF.jpg"},"summary":"　　在古欧洲的农庄里，被女巫雅加婆婆使役的鸡蛋公主整日过著奴仆般的生活。某一天鸡蛋公主拍打的酵母突然意外地拥有着生命，之后鸡蛋公主与酵母君打算俩人一同偷偷逃开， 远离被雅加婆婆操控的日子。\r\n　　剧情为宫崎骏从16世纪画家老彼得·布吕赫尔的画作“收割者”（The Harvesters）所获取的灵感。\r\n　　而宫崎骏也注意到：就像日本童话“老鼠与饭团”（おむすびころりん）故事中乱滚动到老鼠洞底下饭团的情节、西方也有面包自行逃跑类似的童话故事，于是便想创作一个关于面包种逃亡的动画。","name":"パン種とタマゴ姫","name_cn":"酵母君与鸡蛋公主","tags":[{"name":"宫崎骏","count":52,"total_count":38840},{"name":"短片","count":45,"total_count":102482},{"name":"吉卜力","count":44,"total_count":42969},{"name":"2010","count":30,"total_count":43615},{"name":"剧场版","count":22,"total_count":725916},{"name":"原创","count":11,"total_count":621573},{"name":"久石让","count":11,"total_count":14496},{"name":"宮崎駿","count":8,"total_count":10834},{"name":"酵母君与鸡蛋公主","count":7,"total_count":7},{"name":"GHIBLI","count":4,"total_count":1480},{"name":"日本动画","count":3,"total_count":34925},{"name":"日本","count":3,"total_count":298701},{"name":"高坂希太郎","count":3,"total_count":556},{"name":"スタジオジブリ","count":2,"total_count":502},{"name":"独立剧场版","count":2,"total_count":966},{"name":"萌","count":2,"total_count":71365},{"name":"6(+1)","count":1,"total_count":406},{"name":"Short","count":1,"total_count":1547},{"name":"补番","count":1,"total_count":10301},{"name":"2010年11月","count":1,"total_count":98},{"name":"武重洋二","count":1,"total_count":22},{"name":"奇幻","count":1,"total_count":473096},{"name":"undefined","count":1,"total_count":3513},{"name":"动画短片","count":1,"total_count":2074},{"name":"田中敦子","count":1,"total_count":198},{"name":"动画","count":1,"total_count":35753},{"name":"其它","count":1,"total_count":917},{"name":"2010年","count":1,"total_count":2388},{"name":"新世纪OVA及剧场","count"